			  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#2C3E50] mb-6 flex items-center">
				<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#4ECDC4] mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
				  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
				</svg>
				Registration Process
